#: ../../configuration.md:1
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration"

#: ../../configuration.md:3
msgid ""
"Worker tuning is done via `TASK_WORKER_*` environment variables. All of "
"them have sane defaults for local development — set them in production as"
" needed."
msgstr ""
"Die Feinabstimmung des Workers erfolgt über die Umgebungsvariablen "
"`TASK_WORKER_*`. Alle haben sinnvolle Standardwerte für die lokale "
"Entwicklung — setze sie in der Produktion nach Bedarf."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Variable"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Standardwert"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Zweck"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Threads processing tasks in parallel."
msgstr "Threads, die Aufgaben parallel verarbeiten."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_STALE_MINUTES`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_STALE_MINUTES`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`5`"
msgstr "`5`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"A task stuck `RUNNING` (worker crash/OOM) is recovered to `READY` after "
"this many minutes."
msgstr ""
"Eine Aufgabe, die im Status `RUNNING` hängen bleibt (Absturz/OOM des "
"Workers), wird nach dieser Anzahl Minuten auf `READY` zurückgesetzt."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_BACKOFF_BASE_S`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_BACKOFF_BASE_S`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`30`"
msgstr "`30`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Base delay for exponential backoff between retries."
msgstr "Basis-Verzögerung für den exponentiellen Backoff zwischen Wiederholungen."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_HEARTBEAT_S`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_HEARTBEAT_S`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Fallback polling interval while waiting on `LISTEN`/`NOTIFY` (covers "
"deferred tasks whose `run_after` has just elapsed)."
msgstr ""
"Fallback-Polling-Intervall während des Wartens auf `LISTEN`/`NOTIFY` "
"(deckt verzögerte Aufgaben ab, deren `run_after` gerade abgelaufen ist)."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_DB_ALIAS`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_DB_ALIAS`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`\"default\"`"
msgstr "`\"default\"`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Which `DATABASES` alias the worker connects through. Point this at a "
"separate alias (with its own pool sized for `TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY + "
"1`) if you don't want the worker sharing a connection pool with your web "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Über welchen `DATABASES`-Alias sich der Worker verbindet. Verweise damit "
"auf einen separaten Alias (mit eigenem Pool, dimensioniert für "
"`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY + 1`), wenn der Worker sich den Connection-Pool "
"nicht mit deinem Web-Prozess teilen soll."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_SPAN_PREFIX`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_SPAN_PREFIX`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`\"django_task_psql\"`"
msgstr "`\"django_task_psql\"`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Prefix for OpenTelemetry span names (`<prefix>.<task_path>`). Only "
"relevant if the `otel` extra is installed."
msgstr ""
"Präfix für OpenTelemetry-Span-Namen (`<prefix>.<task_path>`). Nur "
"relevant, wenn das `otel`-Extra installiert ist."

#: ../../configuration.md:14
msgid ""
"A CLI flag (`--concurrency`, `--queues`) always overrides its "
"corresponding environment variable."
msgstr ""
"Ein CLI-Flag (`--concurrency`, `--queues`) hat immer Vorrang vor der "
"entsprechenden Umgebungsvariable."

